        "en": {
          "title": "Cook and roll omelette layers",
          "description": "Pour a thin layer of the egg mixture into the pan, tilting to spread evenly. When the egg sets, carefully roll it into a log using a spatula. Push the roll to the edge of the pan, brush the empty surface with oil, and pour another thin layer. When set, roll again. Repeat until all the mixture is used."
